{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e34d28057c0e91d57450ae6d1386687000f37e5e27a6a1e4abff68d3eff9256", "ja": "（もうすぐ、星梨花の劇場初ステージが始まる……）", "zh": "（不久后，星梨花就要在剧场带来首次登台表演了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f1ffcb8805c907eb76ea423df313d1c2a6bfd272be21340f8e8174cb60159bdb", "ja": "（さっき見た時は、かなり緊張してたみたいだけど……\n大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（刚才看到她时，她好像很紧张……\n她还好吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "37584b3e90f4e26b61bf6eb10f8e362cbdff3369c1938c021c5e373e11a3bf38", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！\nあ、あのっ！　た、助けてくださいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！\n那、那个！请、请帮帮我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cabb391005793fb675fa1f1bf917c37254f797e291c74fcc80ee1918e480a5e6", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ、星梨花！？\n顔が真っ青じゃないか？", "zh": "怎、怎么啦，星梨花！？\n你的脸很苍白耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "c376029bac0833dbfd0b8dc491c4239ae963f48c2f4eed9734d73352369ceb83", "ja": "も、もうすぐ本番だって思ったら、\n急に、手と足が震えてきちゃって……。", "zh": "我、我一想到快要正式上台了，\n手脚就突然开始发抖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "97c131b7638dbcad609f68f695437cd364dd454c6c72d29194a52aa48f08647d", "ja": "お水を飲んでも、深呼吸しても\n止まらないんですっ。ど、どうすればいいですか？", "zh": "就算喝了水、做了深呼吸也都停不下来。\n我、我该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "794ddb101db27edca743e5283faa59bccfea31594bd63a7228bb5cb56ad38103", "ja": "星梨花……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "8b2ab1c33fd7667ede45de01970e9635d7e1b330b2c91dda067884b03655c05e", "ja": "でも、こんなにドキドキするのは初めてで。\nなんだか、恐くなっちゃって……ううっ……。", "zh": "而且，我的心从没有跳得这么快过。\n总觉得有点害怕……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "08e31068685f31f57aab4e1aea5c815e95d7122498e604a0a593b1add26998f7", "ja": "そうだったのか……でも、大丈夫だよ。\n誰だって最初は緊張するものだし。", "zh": "这样啊……不过没事的，\n每个人一开始都会紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "8acd19120f0e58f8b940b6654d7ae6dc958e1061d855f045d26abe76951ca2ef", "ja": "で、でもっ！\nこんなに体が震えてたら、ちゃんと踊れないかも……。", "zh": "可、可是！\n如果身体抖成这样，可能舞会跳不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "f01ee6212fe5bfb392332cfedaef5cc845619fccf61385ec545e8dbad4a41ec7", "ja": "声も出なくて、みんなに迷惑をかけちゃうかも\nしれません……。そうなったらどうしましょうっ？", "zh": "也可能发不出声音，给大家添麻烦……\n要是那样该怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fdb4b6b6feec6b811a0a3e04eb83c0221ba56af06f680e75377219f9b36262e6", "ja": "星梨花、落ち着いて。\nちゃんと俺の目を見て。", "zh": "星梨花，你冷静点。\n好好看着我的眼睛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "好、好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c9595f3b3d9e701dfb284668426da992b0d89eca501b68162efd4dd39acef6af", "ja": "星梨花はどうして、\nアイドルになろうと思ったんだっけ？", "zh": "星梨花，\n你为什么想当偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "a5c003d66a0d2c4645cd14e0789ea61ad1c7ba19caae1e1e1e17ef8cb71d4b0f", "ja": "わたしが、アイドルになろうと思った理由……ですか？", "zh": "这是在问我想当偶像的理由……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "017852651ce10d82c60cd787b0b918ceb96842984c6cf7912499a66fe61d5271", "ja": "わ、わたしは、世の中の色んなことが知りたくて……。\n今まで見たことのない世界が見てみたくて……。", "zh": "我、我是因为想知道这世上更多的事……\n想看看过去未曾见过的世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "184045fc0259d4f481b32852a1229d350ad534ea96dcc7124e393acfee559fa0", "ja": "そうだな。それじゃあ、\n今からその願いを叶えに行こうか？", "zh": "对啊。那么，\n现在就去实现这个愿望吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "787252dc29f6db5e8dbc7c3897a8df5047a0d55ddb8352500d73eea7b8422de0", "ja": "えっ？　い、今からですか？", "zh": "咦？现、现在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "53d9fa5dcd7fd9c9daf9aeb7cbd12aeb3dcdeafaafcc05052618fdc6cc366779", "ja": "ステージに立ったら、今まで見たことがない景色が\n見られるぞ！　……ワクワクしてこないか？", "zh": "只要站上舞台，就能看到未曾见过的景色喔！\n……你不会觉得很兴奋吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "196ffb74bde6de191071b4c0ec59fb743112d968099d903bafccf69c6a15d206", "ja": "は、はい……。なんだか、胸のドキドキが、\nワクワクになってきた気がします。", "zh": "会、会觉得……\n感觉心中的紧张开始转为兴奋了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "086c101dd92a74b4252db9aac9dac7301f951c8ddd7b4cdd46f670719c5f8e2c", "ja": "これから星梨花が上がるステージは、初めて見る、\n新しい世界だよな。", "zh": "毕竟星梨花接下来要站上的舞台，\n是你第一次看见的新世界嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "a3b687efaba9e0687f958c485ef663970a1755cc2555d181c83ad130ba8bbc78", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nわたし……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "81eba19b6bab366ca199be7f39b3dbf028ffd7125185d3ead886a72151740e5c", "ja": "新しい世界を見てみたいです！　ステージに立って、\n今まで知らなかった景色を見たいですっ！", "zh": "我想去看看新世界！\n我想站上舞台，看看未曾见过的景色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b7acc12453cd5853e2210a7b6d9b3651eebd2165e7ed7bb688d1d0a56dd1478d", "ja": "よし！　じゃあ、行ってこい。\nちゃんとここで見てるからな！", "zh": "很好！那就去吧。\n我会好好在这里看着的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac352a5a03c71a9da0ff7ac9bf132ea04802ad5e427522319ae15124abe883e6", "ja": "はい！　ずっとずっと、見ててくださいね！\nわたし、行ってきます……！", "zh": "好的！你要一直一直看着我喔！\n我上台了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "424ae50c9c7391de488c60e0bf250797280f8a26c8a384c84aacda5a0e7fc0a0", "ja": "（勇気を出して、ステージに駆け出した星梨花は、\nその後、ステージで最高の笑顔を咲かせた……）", "zh": "（提起勇气，跑上舞台的星梨花，\n之后在表演中，绽放了最棒的笑容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
